{"unit_id":"YumenoSayuri__dsh-github-sync#card-zh","repo":"YumenoSayuri/dsh-github-sync","commit":"31b31678ed5117260abbee94664730ec09ad0b7b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"GitHub 同步（DSH 插件，命令和工具）：按需把工作区里的插件发布到各自的 GitHub 仓库。它通过 /git 命令启动检查或同步流程，并提供状态查询、发布计划和推送工具。主要功能包括扫描工作区目标、预览文件变更、生成增量 Git 提交并推送，以及按配置创建仓库和设置 topic。适合需要从 DSH 工作区维护 GitHub 插件仓库的开发者。真实发布需要 GitHub 账号和 token；本机需要 Git。","source":"generated","evidence":["main.mjs:429-448","main.mjs:483-545","core/sync.js:337-420"]}
{"unit_id":"YumenoSayuri__dsh-github-sync#card-en","repo":"YumenoSayuri/dsh-github-sync","commit":"31b31678ed5117260abbee94664730ec09ad0b7b","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"GitHub Sync is a DSH command and tool for publishing workspace plugins to GitHub. Use /git to inspect targets, preview changes, and create incremental commits. It can create repositories and set topics. Publishing requires local Git and a GitHub token.","source":"generated","evidence":["main.mjs:429-448","main.mjs:483-545","core/sync.js:337-420"]}
