{"unit_id":"YumenoSayuri__dsh-github-sync#feature-1","repo":"YumenoSayuri/dsh-github-sync","commit":"31b31678ed5117260abbee94664730ec09ad0b7b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"GitHub 同步的功能「查询状态」：检查 GitHub 账号与 token 配置、本机 Git 可用性，并汇报工作区发现的目标和文件规模。通过状态工具查看，不会执行推送。","source":"generated","evidence":["main.mjs:483-491","main.mjs:116-130"]}
{"unit_id":"YumenoSayuri__dsh-github-sync#feature-2","repo":"YumenoSayuri/dsh-github-sync","commit":"31b31678ed5117260abbee94664730ec09ad0b7b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"GitHub 同步的功能「预览发布计划」：列出目标仓库、将发布的文件及体积，并说明排除项。调用计划工具并可用 verbose 展开排除清单；该操作只生成预览。","source":"generated","evidence":["main.mjs:494-517"]}
{"unit_id":"YumenoSayuri__dsh-github-sync#feature-3","repo":"YumenoSayuri/dsh-github-sync","commit":"31b31678ed5117260abbee94664730ec09ad0b7b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"GitHub 同步的功能「提交并推送」：把目标的干净副本同步到本地镜像，生成 Git 提交并推送到对应 GitHub 仓库；工具可按配置创建缺失仓库。通过推送工具指定目标，可选 dryRun 仅预览本地变更。","source":"generated","evidence":["main.mjs:520-545","core/sync.js:401-420","core/git.js:401-465"]}
{"unit_id":"YumenoSayuri__dsh-github-sync#feature-4","repo":"YumenoSayuri/dsh-github-sync","commit":"31b31678ed5117260abbee94664730ec09ad0b7b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"GitHub 同步的功能「选择发布目标」：按插件名选择扫描发现的目录，也可直接提供相对或绝对路径。计划和推送工具都接受目标数组，省略时处理发现的全部目标。","source":"generated","evidence":["main.mjs:500-506","main.mjs:527-532","core/sync.js:164-250"]}
